The Docker image additionally contains the following software, each under its own license.
Sharewerk runs the downloaders and FFmpeg as separate programs and does not modify them.
faster-whisper reads audio through PyAV, whose wheels bring a second copy of the FFmpeg
libraries, built by the PyAV project and loaded into the Python process.

