  CTranslate2         MIT                              https://github.com/OpenNMT/CTranslate2
  PyAV                BSD-3-Clause                     https://github.com/PyAV-Org/PyAV
  FFmpeg (PyAV wheel) LGPL-3.0-or-later build, linked  https://github.com/PyAV-Org/pyav-ffmpeg
