The Whisper model weights (MIT, https://huggingface.co/Systran) are not part of the image;
Sharewerk downloads them from Hugging Face on first use.

The full license texts of the Python packages are in the image under
/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/*/, those of the Debian packages under
